recommend keep-going the true staircase is what remains, and it is named and sized: tell_desist_tail at fifty-two lines in eight rungs and tell_beckon_own at thirty-four to a hundred and eleven in seven. Both read tiers through raw inner nesting written at a different depth in every rung, so neither a hash nor a mask reaches them. What they want is the move fold F made once by hand -- an accessor born for each raw tier, widened one word per rung, so the body above lifts and the staircase stays where it is written. Size it by counting the raw nesting lines per body first, since that count is the whole cost of the fold.
